      "seed": 636352585,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 829293676,
      "text": "integer_sqrt(n)               floor(sqrt(n)), Babylonian iteration\ninitial_lp_tokens(a, b)       sqrt(a * b)                       -> deposit, first\nlp_tokens_for_deposit(..)     min( a*S/Ra , b*S/Rb )            -> deposit, later\namount_for_lp(lp, R, S)       lp * R / S                        -> withdraw\nfee_amount(in, bps)           in * bps / 10_000                 -> swap\nswap_output(in, Rin, Rout)    Rout * in / (Rin + in)            -> swap\nmul_div(a, b, c)              a * b / c   in u128, checked      -> everywhere",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "integer_sqrt(n)               floor(sqrt(n)), Babylonian iteration\ninitial_lp_tokens(a, b)       sqrt(a * b)                       -> deposit, first\nlp_tokens_for_deposit(..)     min( a*S/Ra , b*S/Rb )            -> deposit, later\namount_for_lp(lp, R, S)       lp * R / S                        -> withdraw\nfee_amount(in, bps)           in * bps / 10_000                 -> swap\nswap_output(in, Rin, Rout)    Rout * in / (Rin + in)            -> swap\nmul_div(a, b, c)              a * b / c   in u128, checked      -> everywhere",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
