      "seed": 422173362,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1475265434,
      "text": "no pause switch      an is_paused flag on swap + deposit, never on withdraw,\n                     so an incident can never trap funds\n\nMINIMUM_LIQUIDITY    a floor, not a burn - the first depositor can still exit fully,\n                     unlike Uniswap V2 which locks it permanently\n\nToken-2022           not supported, anchor_spl::token only\n\ntreasury sweeping    off-program, the authority moves fees itself",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "no pause switch      an is_paused flag on swap + deposit, never on withdraw,\n                     so an incident can never trap funds\n\nMINIMUM_LIQUIDITY    a floor, not a burn - the first depositor can still exit fully,\n                     unlike Uniswap V2 which locks it permanently\n\nToken-2022           not supported, anchor_spl::token only\n\ntreasury sweeping    off-program, the authority moves fees itself",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
